*>   2009-11-04 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 436
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FRDNIGHT STEP030
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FRD0036.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    05 TXN-CHANNEL        PIC X.
    *> CARD PRESENT Y/N
    05 CARD-PRES-FLG      PIC X.
    *> TRANSACTION AMOUNT
    05 TXN-AMT            PIC 9(7)V99.
01 OUT-RECORD.
    *> HOLD TRANSACTION FLAG
    05 TXN-HOLD-IND       PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    05 REVIEW-FLAG        PIC X VALUE 'N'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM CHECK-CHANNEL
    DISPLAY "TXN-HOLD-IND=" TXN-HOLD-IND
    DISPLAY "REVIEW-FLAG=" REVIEW-FLAG
    STOP RUN.
CHECK-CHANNEL.
    IF TXN-CHANNEL = 'O'
        *> CARD-NOT-PRESENT ONLINE PURCHASE - LIMIT 750 PER 1998 POLICY
        IF CARD-PRES-FLG = 'N' AND TXN-AMT > 500
            MOVE 'Y' TO TXN-HOLD-IND
            MOVE 'Y' TO REVIEW-FLAG
        ELSE
            *> LARGE ONLINE TRANSACTION - LIMIT 2500 PER 1998 POLICY
            IF TXN-AMT > 5000
                MOVE 'Y' TO REVIEW-FLAG
            END-IF
        END-IF
    END-IF.
